  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize capturing 'Junk' (Pi) cards early. While small, getting 10 Junk cards is the easiest way to reach your first point. Watch for opponents trying to get 'Godori'.\n\nThe 'Shake': If you have 3 of the same month in hand, 'shake' them (show them) to double your score if you win.\n\nRisk Math: Only call 'Go' if you have a clear path to your next point (e.g., you only need one more ribbon) AND you know your opponents are far from their target score.",
